---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import WhatsAppCTA from '../components/WhatsAppCTA.astro';
import QuickFacts from '../components/QuickFacts.astro';
import { SITE, waLink } from '../data/site';

const heroImage = 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/9275222/pexels-photo-9275222.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1920';
const conferenceImage = 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/26202153/pexels-photo-26202153.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800';
const meetingImage = 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181738/pexels-photo-1181738.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800';

const title = 'Antalya Business Tourism & MICE Travel Services | Tours Antalya';
const description = 'Plan corporate events, MICE travel, conferences, and golf retreats in Antalya, Turkey. VIP business travel services with luxury hotel venues and professional event management.';

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: SITE.url },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Business Tourism', item: `${SITE.url}/antalya-business-tourism/` },
  ],
};

const serviceSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'Antalya Business & MICE Travel Services',
  provider: { '@type': 'TravelAgency', name: SITE.name, url: SITE.url },
  areaServed: 'Antalya, Turkey',
  description: 'Corporate event planning, MICE travel, conference venues, golf tourism, and business retreats in Antalya.',
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} schema={[breadcrumbSchema, serviceSchema]} canonical="/antalya-business-tourism/">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative flex min-h-[50vh] items-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img src={heroImage} alt="Business conference in Antalya" class="h-full w-full object-cover" fetchpriority="high" width="1920" height="1080" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-950/90 via-primary-950/75 to-primary-950/50"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-white/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-primary-200 backdrop-blur-sm">
          Business & Trade Hub
        </span>
        <h1 class="mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
          Antalya Business Tourism & MICE Travel
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-100">
          The Turkish Riviera is not just a leisure destination. Antalya has become a global hub
          for meetings, incentives, conferences, and exhibitions, offering world-class venues,
          championship golf, and luxury hospitality for corporate travelers.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <WhatsAppCTA label="Plan Your Business Event" message="Hello, I am interested in business travel and MICE services in Antalya." />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Breadcrumb items={[
    { name: 'Home', href: '/' },
    { name: 'Business Tourism', href: '/antalya-business-tourism/' },
  ]} />

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 lg:px-8">
    <QuickFacts
      title="Key Takeaways"
      items={[
        { label: 'MICE capacity', value: '2,583 hotel establishments, 647,628 beds' },
        { label: 'Major events hosted', value: 'NATO Summit, COP31, EXPO 2016' },
        { label: 'Golf courses', value: '15+ championship courses in Belek' },
        { label: 'Convention centers', value: 'Multiple venues with 7,500+ capacity' },
        { label: 'Airport access', value: 'Antalya Airport (AYT), 3 terminals' },
        { label: 'Best season for MICE', value: 'September to May (mild weather)' },
      ]}
    />
  </div>

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pb-12 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900">
      Antalya: A Global MICE Destination
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      Antalya has firmly established itself as one of the world's premier destinations for MICE
      tourism, which encompasses Meetings, Incentives, Conferences, and Exhibitions. The city's
      unique combination of modern infrastructure, Mediterranean climate, and luxury hospitality
      makes it an ideal choice for organizations seeking a distinctive setting for their corporate
      events. With over 2,583 hotel establishments and 647,628 beds, Antalya has the capacity to
      host events of any scale, from intimate executive board meetings to massive international
      congresses.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      The city has proven its capability by hosting landmark global events, including the NATO
      Summit, which brought world leaders to Antalya's shores, and COP31, the United Nations
      Climate Change Conference. EXPO 2016 further demonstrated Antalya's ability to orchestrate
      large-scale international gatherings. These events have left a lasting legacy of upgraded
      infrastructure, enhanced security protocols, and a hospitality sector that understands the
      specific needs of corporate and government delegations.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900">
      Luxury Hotel Conference Facilities
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      Antalya's top resorts double as world-class conference venues, offering state-of-the-art
      meeting rooms, exhibition halls, and breakout spaces alongside their leisure amenities.
      Properties like Maxx Royal Belek and Regnum Carya feature dedicated congress centers with
      capacities exceeding 1,000 delegates, simultaneous translation booths, high-speed internet,
      and professional audiovisual equipment. These venues allow organizations to combine productive
      business sessions with golf tournaments, spa retreats, and gala dinners, all within a single
      property.
    </p>

    <div class="my-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg">
        <img src={conferenceImage} alt="Conference hall with attendees in Antalya" class="w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="400" height="250" />
      </div>
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg">
        <img src={meetingImage} alt="Corporate meeting in a modern Antalya hotel" class="w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="400" height="250" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="mt-8 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900">
      Top Conference Hotels in Antalya
    </h3>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-base text-neutral-700">
      <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0369a1" stroke-width="2" class="mt-1 flex-shrink-0"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
        <span><strong>Maxx Royal Belek</strong> and <strong>Regnum Carya</strong> offer dedicated congress centers with 1,000+ delegate capacity, simultaneous translation, and gala dinner venues for up to 2,000 guests.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0369a1" stroke-width="2" class="mt-1 flex-shrink-0"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
        <span><strong>Mardan Palace</strong> provides opulent meeting spaces and a grand ballroom suitable for high-profile government and corporate summits.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0369a1" stroke-width="2" class="mt-1 flex-shrink-0"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
        <span><strong>Rixos Premium Belek</strong> features a convention center with modular meeting rooms and beachfront event spaces.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0369a1" stroke-width="2" class="mt-1 flex-shrink-0"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
        <span><strong>Concorde De Luxe Resort Lara</strong> offers versatile conference facilities just 10 minutes from Antalya Airport.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-12 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900">
      Golf Tourism in Belek
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      Belek, situated between Antalya and Side, has become synonymous with golf tourism in Turkey.
      The region boasts more than 15 championship golf courses, many designed by golfing legends
      such as Colin Montgomerie, Sir Nick Faldo, and Ian Poulter. A <strong>Belek golf hotel and
      spa package</strong> is the ideal choice for corporate incentive trips, combining team-building
      on the fairways with luxury spa treatments and fine dining in the evenings.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      Courses like the Regnum Carya Golf & Resort Club, Cullinan Links Golf Club, and the Montgomerie
      Maxx Royal have hosted the Turkish Airlines Open, part of the European Tour. These
      world-class facilities are set against a stunning backdrop of pine forests, eucalyptus trees,
      and the shimmering Mediterranean, providing an unforgettable golfing experience for players of
      all skill levels. We arrange complete golf packages including tee times, equipment rental,
      golf academy sessions, and clubhouse dining.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900">
      Corporate Retreats and Incentive Travel
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      An <strong>Antalya summer vacation business travel</strong> combination is increasingly
      popular among companies looking to reward top performers or conduct strategic off-site
      meetings. The region's all-inclusive luxury resorts make budgeting straightforward, while
      the wide range of activities, from Jeep safaris in the Taurus Mountains to yacht cruises
      along the coast, provides endless team-building opportunities.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      Our corporate retreat packages include private meeting room rentals, customized team-building
      activities, gala dinner organization, audiovisual equipment, airport transfers for all
      delegates, and 24/7 on-site coordination. Whether you are planning a 10-person executive
      strategy session or a 500-person annual company celebration, we handle every detail with
      precision and discretion.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900">
      Antalya Trade & Investment Opportunities
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      Beyond tourism, Antalya presents significant trade and investment opportunities. The city's
      strategic location on the Mediterranean, with excellent air connectivity to Europe, the Middle
      East, and Central Asia, makes it an attractive hub for international business. The Antalya
      Free Zone, established to promote export-oriented investment, hosts companies in sectors
      ranging from manufacturing to technology services.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      The tourism sector itself offers investment potential, with the region's 2,583 hotel
      establishments and 647,628 beds representing a mature infrastructure with room for
      innovation in boutique properties, eco-tourism, and wellness retreats. The local government
      actively supports foreign investment through incentives and streamlined procedures, making
      Antalya an accessible entry point for businesses looking to establish a presence in Turkey.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      For business travelers looking to combine trade exploration with tourism, our services
      include arranging meetings with local partners, factory and site visits, translation
      services, and tailored itineraries that maximize productive time while showcasing the best
      of Antalya. We also assist with <a href="https://tourviza.ir/تور-آنتالیا-از-ارومیه/" class="text-primary-600 underline hover:text-primary-700">تور آنتالیا از ارومیه</a> connections for Persian-speaking business travelers and offer access to a <a href="https://www.sevlux.ir/vip-services/luxury-yacht-charter-istanbul/" class="text-primary-600 underline hover:text-primary-700">luxury yacht charter Istanbul</a> for high-level networking events.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary-50 p-8 text-center">
      <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900">
        Ready to Plan Your Business Event in Antalya?
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-neutral-600">
        Contact us on WhatsApp for customized MICE packages, conference venue selection, and
        corporate retreat planning. Our local experts respond within minutes.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <WhatsAppCTA label="Get a Business Quote" message="Hello, I would like to plan a business event or corporate retreat in Antalya. Please provide details and quotes." />
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
